## .NET
bin/
obj/
*.user

## Logs written by the app at runtime
logs/

## The vault is user data, not source — never commit it by default.
## Not anchored to the repo root: the default `Vault:RootPath` ("vault")
## resolves relative to the app's content root, i.e. src/DotNotes.Api/vault/
## when run from there, not a repo-root-level vault/.
vault/

## IDE / OS cruft
.vs/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store

## Windows "mark of the web" sidecar files, picked up when files are
## copied off an NTFS volume (e.g. via a Windows-side file transfer).
*:Zone.Identifier

#local folders
/assets

## tests/e2e (Playwright, dev-only test tooling - see tests/e2e/README.md):
## Node deps, downloaded browser artifacts, and the throwaway test vault
## must never be committed. The spec files themselves (tests/e2e/*.js,
## tests/e2e/specs/) ARE committed.
tests/e2e/node_modules/
tests/e2e/.chromium-libs/
tests/e2e/.e2e-vault/
tests/e2e/test-results/
tests/e2e/playwright-report/
tests/e2e/.cache/
